reatest value"}, {"start_seconds": 276.48, "end_seconds": 281.36, "text": "well let's plug in a few numbers"}, {"start_seconds": 278.4, "end_seconds": 284.32, "text": "so let's say this is p hat"}, {"start_seconds": 281.36, "end_seconds": 284.32, "text": "one minus p-hat"}, {"start_seconds": 284.96, "end_seconds": 288.16, "text": "and then"}, {"start_seconds": 285.92, "end_seconds": 291.12, "text": "on the right will be the product"}, {"start_seconds": 288.16, "end_seconds": 291.12, "text": "of these two figures"}, {"start_seconds": 291.28, "end_seconds": 296.64, "text": "so the maximum value of p is one"}, {"start_seconds": 294.0, "end_seconds": 298.4, "text": "if we choose a value of one this is zero"}, {"start_seconds": 296.64, "end_seconds": 299.6, "text": "the product will be zero so that's not"}, {"start_seconds": 298.4, "end_seconds": 302.72, "text": "good"}, {"start_seconds": 299.6, "end_seconds": 304.48, "text": "let's say if we were to choose"}, {"start_seconds": 302.72, "end_seconds": 306.48, "text": "point seven"}, {"start_seconds": 304.48, "end_seconds": 308.64, "text": "then this will be point three one minus"}, {"start_seconds": 306.48, "end_seconds": 311.04, "text": "point seven is point three"}, {"start_seconds": 308.64, "end_seconds": 313.04, "text": "point seven times 0.3"}, {"start_seconds": 311.04, "end_seconds": 315.36, "text": "that's 0.21"}, {"start_seconds": 313.04, "end_seconds": 318.24, "text": "if p-hat was 0.6"}, {"start_seconds": 315.36, "end_seconds": 319.44, "text": "1 minus p-hat will be 0.4"}, {"start_seconds": 318.24, "end_seconds": 321.44, "text": "0.6"}, {"start_seconds": 319.44, "end_seconds": 323.68, "text": "times 0.4"}, {"start_seconds": 321.44, "end_seconds": 326.08, "text": "is 0.24"}, {"start_seconds": 323.68, "end_seconds": 328.8, "text": "now if p hat is 0.5"}, {"start_seconds": 326.08, "end_seconds": 332.4, "text": "1 minus p hat will be 0.5"}, {"start_seconds": 328.8, "end_seconds": 333.44, "text": "the product of thes